n  doing what i do now my dream was to be a  mother  and i have three brothers and i helped  bomb with them  and seeing how they've grown up and  things  took after uh me even things i've taught  them  it's just so special and you really  helped mold somebody  and it's just this unconditional love  that i have for them  and i can't imagine what it's gonna be  like when i have my own child  and get to do that with them  [Music]
 

